    <title>
        <en>FORGE Engine</en>
    </title>

    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[
FORGE — Farming Operations & Regional Growth Engine.

Development foundation providing:
- Multiplayer-first mission lifecycle
- Savegame-embedded persistence
- Module registry
- Internal event bus
- Shared state store
- Data-driven campaign scaffolding

This development build adds the first XML-driven campaign and live Projects app integration.
        ]]></en>
    </description>

    <iconFilename>icon_forge.dds</iconFilename>
    <multiplayer supported="true"/>

